    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937590/extras/f53d164e9f68cb9c5983e8f1c31d0a23.poster.avif?t=1754587088\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937590/extras/f53d164e9f68cb9c5983e8f1c31d0a23.webm?t=1754587088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937590/extras/65f15783569def811c54c3fb4d7e5a53.poster.avif?t=1754587088\" width=800 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2937590/extras/65f15783569def811c54c3fb4d7e5a53.webm?t=1754587088\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd14\u00a0Dozens of &quot;artifacts&quot; to discover and chumpos to meet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Clean artifacts perfectly... or don't and see what happens!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2e\u00a0Different endings can unlock if you're a good gob or not</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfbb\u00a0Original soundtrack to vibe to while cleaning</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3d\u00a0Play as a goblin and learn the unique and intricate dialect of &quot;gob-speak&quot;</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u23f3\u00a0 Designed to be completed in a single sitting (~2 hours, less if you're a bad gob)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc2d\u00a0Playable with just a mouse</strong> </p></li></ul><p class